# Generated single-file interactive diagrams (archify).
#
# These are build artifacts, not authored source: each ~800 KB HTML inlines the
# same archify runtime (≈281 KB CSS + ≈484 KB JS), and they are rendered from the
# committed *.architecture.json / *.sequence.json / *.workflow.json specs next to
# them. 109 tracked files total ≈85 MB, which otherwise makes GitHub's language
# statistics report this repository as ~90% HTML.
#
# linguist-generated = "Excluded from stats, hidden in diffs".
archify/*.html                  linguist-generated
docs-site/static/archify/*.html linguist-generated
